mayaiva vihitān hi tān\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":2276,\"bb\":2017,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/22/b2017/\",\"shadow_value\":\"saḥ – he; tayā – with that; śraddhayā – inspiration; yuktaḥ – endowed; tasya – of that demigod; ārādhanam – for the worship; īhate – he aspires; labhate – obtains; ca – and; tataḥ – from that; kāmān – his desires; mayā – by Me; eva – alone; vihitān – arranged; hi – certainly; tān – those.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"},{\"word\":\"tayā\",\"translation\":\"with that\"},{\"word\":\"śraddhayā\",\"translation\":\"inspiration\"},{\"word\":\"yuktaḥ\",\"translation\":\"endowed\"},{\"word\":\"tasya\",\"translation\":\"of that demigod\"},{\"word\":\"ārādhanam\",\"translation\":\"for the worship\"},{\"word\":\"īhate\",\"translation\":\"he aspires\"},{\"word\":\"labhate\",\"translation\":\"obtains\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"tataḥ\",\"translation\":\"from that\"},{\"word\":\"kāmān\",\"translation\":\"his desires\"},{\"word\":\"mayā\",\"translation\":\"by Me\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"alone\"},{\"word\":\"vihitān\",\"translation\":\"arranged\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"tān\",\"translation\":\"those\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":2277,\"bb\":2018,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/22/b2018/\",\"body_value\":\"Endowed with such a faith, he endeavors to worship a particular demigod and obtains his desires. But in actuality these benefits are bestowed by Me alone.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2278,\"bb\":2019,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/22/b2019/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2279,\"bb\":2020,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/22/b2020/\",\"body_value\":\"For the living entity who desires to return to Godhead, material desires are impediments. A pure devotee of the Lord is therefore not awarded the material benefits desired by less intelligent living entities, who therefore prefer to worship demigods of the material world rather than engage in the devotional service of the Supreme Lord.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 7.22\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 7.22\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Library\"}],\" » \"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/bg/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"